    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "## Carlos Recipe Page\r\n\r\nIn this level, we're going to help Carlos, who is struggling with his use of AI. Here is what he says:\r\n\r\n*\"I just wanted one simple recipe page and now there's a bunch of recipes I didn't even ask for. I don't even know where my actual recipe went. It's way too much.\"*\r\n\r\n**Do This:**\r\n1) Read Carlos's `vision.md` file in the file explorer to understand what he asked for\r\n2) Decide how you want to fix it - you can update the `vision.md` file to be more specific, add a new prompt in AI Tutor chat, or both\r\n\r\nKeep working with AI Tutor until you think the webpage addresses Carlos's feedback. Once it does: press the Continue button!\r\n\r\n**Hint:** Think about how you can make Carlos's vision more specific about what he does *not* want - sometimes telling AI what to leave out is just as important as telling it what to include.",
