    "display_name": "Carlos Recipe Page",
    "bubble_choice_description": "Help Carlos wrangle AI tools to help him with his webpage: \"I just wanted one simple recipe page and now there's a bunch of recipes I didn't even ask for.\"",
    "start_sources": {
